Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 09:20:14 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 13/13] nyx_dshot: the DShot frame as the PL sends it, (value
 << 1) | telemetry (11-bit value, then the telemetry bit; it went out as the
 value alone, every motor at half the throttle asked); ESC commands 'nyx_dshot
 reverse|normal|save|beep1..5|cmd -c N [-m motor] [-r repeats]' as PX4's own
 dshot driver, sent only while the motors are stopped, telemetry bit set;
 nyx_fcio.hpp dshot_frame()/dshot_value(); SIH_PL_IO decodes the frame's value

